    "“For a specified equation of state the Tolman–Oppenheimer–Volkoff equations determine the stellar structure; varying the central density (or pressure) and integrating the TOV equations yields the mass–radius relation for that EOS.” (L. Lindblom / reviews such as Lattimer & Prakash, Phys. Rep. reviews on neutron star structure)"
